flowchart TD
    Input[Roadmap state with modules] --> Titles[Collect module titles]
    Titles --> DocsPrompt[LLM prompt for title/article JSON]
    DocsPrompt --> LLM[ChatGroq llm.invoke]
    LLM --> Parse{Parse JSON}
    Parse -->|Success| Map[Map articles by lowercase title]
    Parse -->|Malformed JSON| Empty[Log; empty docs map]
    Map --> ForEach[Process modules with Promise.all]
    Empty --> ForEach
    ForEach --> Search[searchVideo(module title)]
    Search --> Primary[YouTube query: free code camp topic]
    Primary --> Channel{Channel includes freecodecamp.org?}
    Channel -->|Yes| Found[Use video result]
    Channel -->|No| Fallback[YouTube query: topic tutorial]
    Fallback --> Result{Result available?}
    Result -->|Yes| Found
    Result -->|No| NoVideo[Empty video URL]
    Search -->|Caught API error| NoVideo
    Found --> Attach[Attach youtube and article fields]
    NoVideo --> Attach
    Attach --> Output[Return enriched modules]
    DocsPrompt -->|Outer failure| Error[Catch; return state with error]
    ForEach -->|Unexpected failure| Error
